  "quests": [
    {
      "ID": "38618",
      "LogTitle": "'Above the Winter Moonlight'",
      "LogDescription": "'Grapple across from the tower and climb to the top of the mountain path.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'There, it looks like there\\'s a good spot to launch to right across from here. This path should take you all the way to the top.\\n\\nAccording to my  intel, your dragons should be up there. Let\\'s just hope that they\\'re still in a state to help you.'",
      "Flags": "34603016",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38414",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38617",
      "LogTitle": "'Another Way'",
      "LogDescription": "'Defeat the Drekirjar Champion in Hrydshal, then climb to the top of the tower.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'Wait, do you still have that grapple launcher? I think you can still get to the path if you can launch from the top of that tower. The gap doesn\\'t seem too bad there.\\n\\nOf course, we\\'ll have to take out the big guy out front first. He looks tough, but I think we have a chance if we can flank him.'",
      "Flags": "34603016",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38618",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38412",
      "LogTitle": "'Above the Winter Moonlight'",
      "LogDescription": "'Grapple across from the tower and climb to the top of the mountain path.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'You should have a good vantage from this tower to grapple over to the mountain path. I can\\'t help you once you\\'re across, but you should be able to take it all the way up to the top. \\n\\nI hope you\\'re able to find what you need from the dragons up there. Who knows what the God-King has done to them.'",
      "Flags": "34603016",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38414",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38342",
      "LogTitle": "'Another Way'",
      "LogDescription": "'Defeat Gunnlaug Scaleheart in Hrydshal, then climb to the top of the tower.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'Well, the bridge option is out. You still got that grapple launcher handy?\\n\\nIt looks like we can get across from the top of that tower over there. First thing\\'s first, though, we\\'ll need to deal with the big ugly sitting out front.\\n\\nYou take point.'",
      "Flags": "34603016",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38412",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    }
  ],
